hpc:Job a owl:Class .
hpc:UserJob hpc:Job rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Job .
hpc:AccountJob hpc:Job rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Job .

hpc:ActiveJobs a owl:Class .
hpc:ActiveUserJobs a owl:Class, rdfs:subClassOf hpc:ActiveJobs .
hpc:ActiveAccountJobs a owl:Class, rdfs:subClassOf hpc:ActiveJobs .

hpc:Accruing a owl:Class .
